ng: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">如果你仓位比较重或者比较怕的话，到这个位置可以先去减仓或出局</strong></span>。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.540293\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMP3e5UatC47eiabIkpzWpVwGJmLIccw6iboGL8h6xj9KzFiaGMkHfZ2xJDYk2hUvV71WuYPAmOwtKJkg/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"546\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">如果行情能继续透下来的话，在3000点和3100点继续进场，行情不破2863上方的任何一个位置，都具备拉起来走大行情的条件。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5369004\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMP3e5UatC47eiabIkpzWpVwGKxyebH7oyTC6FRClorOcuLAZ58RhicrzHuUPVx3D1cBcbH0KJL9AfTQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"542\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">但是如果以3150的位置反弹至阻力并没有下跌，而是继续创新高的话，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">我们要在3300点追进去，一旦3300点被破坏，也就说明123下跌趋势结束。</strong></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5387454\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMP3e5UatC47eiabIkpzWpVwGIZfJQnTkx6YwzxxNGiaL8hSytDYpWuBmNeyoRgxZyl01qr3BBZxkwQQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"542\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\">行情涨到这儿的话，就确立3155点可能是新一轮上涨的起涨点</span></strong>，或者你等待行情反弹3250回调之后再创新高，下方完成小级别正V型颈线回调颈线进场，<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">不突破3300去追也可以</strong>。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5451197\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMP3e5UatC47eiabIkpzWpVwGzxVoQ1PTuaYGbPrVCHygxQjEdQKib7rhGZSxNQwsYfViawhZuibvoevmA/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"543\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">想做短线就在支撑位置起笔反弹就跑，你准确率最高，想做中长线，上涨趋势下方可能有很多道支撑</strong>，并不知道哪一道支撑会起反弹？哪一道支撑就是底部起大行情？</p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 6, 6);box-sizing: border-box;\">如果你想拿大行情，就做好反弹之后继续创新低，在下方更低的支撑位置，再起大行情的准备，你可以选择减仓之后再持有。</span></strong></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5543278\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMP3e5UatC47eiabIkpzWpVwG4C1H9Z1Gibw3hgyY6wLbxDljlx4HicJ1qibIBC90abpXEa3Py7tDIlUAg/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"543\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"/></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">巴菲特的胜率不到50%，大概42%左右，就是因为他拿的票上方空间大，这就是一个个人取舍的问题。</p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;margin: 16px 0% 10px;font-size: 0px;display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 100 100 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" margin: 5px 0%; box-sizing: b