，或者<span style=\"text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(15, 15, 15);box-sizing: border-box;\">点</span>在看和点赞，平台将会减少推送，甚至不再推送，喜欢“顶底之王”的朋友一定要注意！</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0em;color: rgb(15, 15, 15);box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"/><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">特别提醒：</strong>目前我仅有这一个公众号，其他均为假冒，一定要擦亮眼睛！</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 15, 15);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">免责声明：</strong>此内容仅为个人观点，不构成任何投资建议，据此入市风险自担。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><br/></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" text-align: center;justify-content: center;margin: 10px 0%;display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style='display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 42%;background-position: 100% 83.5452%;background-repeat: no-repeat;background-size: 299.63%;background-attachment: scroll;padding: 44px 29px 29px;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: center;background-image: url(\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMP3e5UatC47eiabIkpzWpVwGvJT1yJzagCdiaibIIsZMU4dJhC2ebuS3icVBg5mPUzXhzsp3vdHvyx71Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\");box-sizing: border-box;'><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\" margin: 0px 0%; box-sizing: border-box; \"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/szVAj3XrnMP3e5UatC47eiabIkpzWpVwGeuCnDafiat5z6SCWVbibkjAHLkFIY4lvVwuITNgQQ3AIQ4SlU4eRGT9A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jp